# Sala 2 de la Liga (Tanko, Fighting, C9, contract 56), 11 x 12, interior, ONE room of the League four run (contract 50.2): FIGHTING: a big light canvas mat (2 x 2) with the dark ring line near the block edge, a padded corner post with ropes at each corner of the ring. column = i, row = j. The hero arrives at (5,10) facing NE; the door BEHIND him (5,11) is a solid NPC that appears when league_run is set;
# the member stands at (5,4) facing SW (+j), the door AHEAD (5,1) is a solid NPC hidden when the member's beaten flag (league_e2) is set, the doorway (5,0) is the warp (`oneway`). No exit warp, no way back (a loss is the blackout to the lobby).
@map liga_lucha
@size 11 12
@interior yes
@bg 0
@fill ringm_00
@spawn in 5 10 NE
@legend
  K  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=wall_j
  |  tile=none object=wall_i
  0  tile=ringm_10 
  1  tile=ringm_11 
  2  tile=ringm_01 
  3  tile=ringm_11 npc=keydoor id=door_a face=S solid=yes gate=yes text=gl.c9.door.locked hide_flag=league_e2
  4  tile=ringm_10 
  5  tile=ringm_00 
  6  tile=ringm_01 object=ringpost
  7  tile=ringm_10 npc=tanko id=member face=SW trainer=tanko text=lg.tanko.pre after=lg.tanko.after beaten_flag=league_e2 range=4
  8  tile=ringm_11 npc=keydoor id=door_x face=S solid=yes gate=yes text=gl.c9.door.shut show_flag=league_run
@grid
  Kwwww0wwwww
  |1212321212
  |4545454545
  |1612121612
  |4545754545
  |1212121212
  |4545454545
  |1212121212
  |4545454545
  |1612121612
  |4545454545
  |1212821212
@warp 0 -> liga_fantasma spawn=in oneway
